sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant OIDC as GitHub OIDC issuer
    participant WIF as GCP WIF provider
    participant IAM as IAM / Service Account
    participant GAR as Artifact Registry
    participant CR as Cloud Run

    Dev->>GH: push to main
    GH->>OIDC: request OIDC token
    OIDC-->>GH: signed JWT
    GH->>WIF: exchange token
    WIF->>IAM: validate mapped claims and condition
    IAM-->>GH: impersonation allowed
    GH->>GAR: push image
    GH->>CR: deploy new revision
